h_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"77309440\"/></p><p><strong>4 Inch Micro Brass Impeller Submersible Pump</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240846394494507.jpg\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/><br/></p><p>JIADI’s principle product contains 4 Inch Micro Brass Impeller Submersible Pump. JIADI has the premise of professional services, focused scientific research and improving enterprise culture to become a world class leading micro-pumps and valves businesses. It continuously devotes to more green and convenient products to work hard for human beings better life.</p><p><strong>1. Product Specification</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Model</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">4FSm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">RPM</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2850</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Warranty</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1 year</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Phase/ Volt</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Single phase; 220-240V</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Insulation class</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">B</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Impeller Material</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Copper</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Maximum Diameter</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">98mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Length</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">418mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Highest Temperature of liquid</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Package</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Wooden box or Carton (with or without plastic foam)</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Power Source</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Submersible</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Yes</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240848597626813.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240846332875450.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240849018313140.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Product Application</strong></p><p>This series product can be applied in many areas like farmland irrigation, water supplying and draining water for ordinary places and so on.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240849035202061.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Company Profile</strong></p><p>JIADI Pump Industry is located in the rapidly developing zone in Wenling, which is known as a “Pump city”. Our company are professional in making various kinds pumps,, like submersible screw pump, submersible multistage pump, submersible peripheral pump and so on. We devote to innovating our technologies, improve our pump-making skills and optimizing our service and so on. We are wishful for more and more customers as well as their trust and praise.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240849082777309.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. JIADI’s Benefits</strong></p><p>1. Advanced technology of making pumps</p><p>2. Professional design team with prudent attitude</p><p>3. Friendly staff and harmonious atmosphere</p><p>4. “Customer and quality oriented” principle</p><p><strong>7. Packing and Delivery</strong></p><p>Major Payment terms: L/C, D/A, D/P, T/T other payment terms welcomed</p><p>Major Trade Terms: FOB, CIF, CFR (CNF)</p><p>Port: Ningbo, Lianyungang, Shanghai</p><p>Shipment: Large order by sea or by air</p><p>Small order by express delivery</p><p>Supply Capability: 100,000 Pieces per Month</p><p>Packing: Wooden box, Carton (with cylinder or foam)</p><p>Lead time: Around 20-30 days</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240849128979323.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>8. Exhibition Show</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240849182883995.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image019(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>9. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: Are you manufacturer or trading company?</strong></p><p>A: We have our own 2 factories to produce 100% products by ourselves. We try our best to offer the most competitive price to our customers.</p><p><strong>2. Q: How about your warranty?</strong></p><p>A: We offer you one year warranty on all purchased that begin with the purchasing date.</p><p><strong>3. Q: Can you provide us your price list for all models?</strong></p><p>A: I’m sorry but we do not present the price list because pumps of different specifications and your order quantity both will affect our quotation. Thus you should let us know your target price and detailed requirements and then we will send you our quotation sheet.</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 4 inch micro brass impeller submersible pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div